      "touchstones": "<h3>Convictions</h3><ul><li>A deal is a deal</li><li>What is buried is not lost</li></ul><h3>Touchstones</h3><ul><li><strong>Dee Watkins</strong>: A shelter worker in Pioneer Square who leaves the back door open for “the ones below” and never asks questions.</li></ul>",
