    "biography": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.dj4gIszHHTN1QRKk]{Profile: Abel Thornquist}</p><blockquote><p><em>“Everything&#39;s for sale below. The only thing that changes is who pays.”</em></p></blockquote><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Epithet</th><td>The Owner Below</td></tr><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Nosferatu Primogen</td></tr><tr><th>Clan</th><td>Nosferatu</td></tr><tr><th>Sect</th><td>Camarilla</td></tr><tr><th>Sire</th><td>“The Mother Below”</td></tr><tr><th>Born</th><td>1863</td></tr><tr><th>Embraced</th><td>1890</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>For no one to be able to rule Seattle without going through what lies below.</td></tr><tr><th>Coterie</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.azX1hjbc0PUp2AA2.JournalEntryPage.Dy9L39SvdB7rns0t]{The Moles}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Huge and hunched, skin like cracked, wet gray wood, a twisted jaw, and fingers like roots; a patched three-piece suit and a carbide lamp.</p>",
